msgid ""
"# VH - linear gamma0\n"
"\n"
"This script displays a grayscale visualization of the gamma0 of the VH "
"polarization. The values for the cross polarization (VH) are generally "
"lower (darker visualization) than for the co-polarization (HH, VV).  The VH "
"polarization has higher values for surfaces characterized by volume "
"scattering, e.g., branches, dry coil bodies, or canopies (lighter color in "
